&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:280}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;is a global product design and technology company, with a diversified portfolio of 5-star rated lifestyle solutions that positively&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;people’s lives in homes around the world. &lt;strong&gt;Powered by two trusted, global brands, Shark and Ninja&lt;/strong&gt;, the company has a proven&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;of bringing disruptive innovation to market and developing one consumer product after another has allowed&amp;nbsp;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;to enter multiple product categories, driving significant growth and market share gains. Headquartered in Needham, Massachusetts with more than&amp;nbsp;4,100&amp;nbsp;associates, the company’s products are sold at key retailers, online and offline, and through distributors around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI at SharkNinja &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SharkNinja, we’re building an AI-native culture. We’re not waiting for the future; we’re creating it. Our people are expected to experiment boldly, adopt new tools, and continuously raise what’s possible to create meaningful impact for our consumers. If you believe the best way to do your job hasn’t been invented yet, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;ABOUT SHARKNINJA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SharkNinja is a global product design and technology company, with a diversified portfolio of 5-star rated lifestyle solutions that positively impact people&#39;s lives in homes around the world. Powered by two trusted, global brands, Shark and Ninja, the company has a proven track record of bringing disruptive innovation to market, and having the speed and agility to obtain significant market share in multiple product categories. As we expand our Direct-to-Consumer footprint globally, we&#39;re building a world-class creative organization to tell our story, drive conversion, and create the most outrageously extraordinary digital experiences in the category.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an Art Director to join our In Market Creative team, based in London and supporting Shark and Ninja&#39;s DTC presence across the EMEA. In this role, you&#39;ll lead the creative development of market-specific campaigns, digital content, and channel creative, ensuring global brand standards come to life in ways that resonate locally. You&#39;ll be a creative generalist with strong art direction instincts, working across digital, social, and CRM touchpoints to drive consumer engagement and conversion in key markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Art direct and design market-specific DTC creative across digital, social, email, and on-site channels for EMEA markets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Partner with the Sr. Manager and regional marketing teams to develop campaign concepts and creative executions that drive DTC performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Adapt global creative platforms to local market needs, maintaining brand consistency while ensuring cultural and market relevance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Lead creative across the full project lifecycle: brief, concept, design, and delivery&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Direct photography, video, and content shoots as needed, managing external talent and production partners&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Collaborate with the Global NPD team to ensure in-market creative is aligned with product launch strategy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Contribute to the development and evolution of the SharkNinja DTC design system and brand voice&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Present creative concepts and strategies to regional and global stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Manage and guide junior designers within the in-market team as the team grows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• 6+ years of experience in art direction, digital design, or creative direction, in-house, agency, or DTC&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Portfolio demonstrating strong art direction across digital campaigns, social, and e-commerce creative&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Excellent graphic design, layout and typography&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience working across multiple markets or adapting global creative for regional audiences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Familiar with producing AI Generative Creative using node-based systems: Flora, Weavy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Proficiency using Open AI or Claude&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Proficiency in Figma and Adobe Creative Suite&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Strong understanding of social content formats and platform-specific creative best practices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience briefing and managing external creative talent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Excellent communication skills, comfortable presenting to senior stakeholders and cross-functional partners&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Highly organized and able to manage multiple projects across different markets simultaneously&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience with consumer electronics, beauty, or lifestyle brands preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WHY SHARKNINJA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Work on two of the most recognized consumer brands in the world&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Be part of a fast-moving, entrepreneurial team that ships at scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Shape the future of creative within DTC, from brand storytelling to conversion optimization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Collaborative, high-performance culture built around the OE (Outrageously Extraordinary) mindset&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Competitive compensation, benefits, and opportunity for growth&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Culture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At SharkNinja, we don’t just raise the bar—we push past it every single day. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Outrageously Extraordinary mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; drives us to tackle the impossible, push boundaries, and deliver results that others only dream of. If you thrive on breaking out of your swim lane, you’ll be right at home.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We offer competitive health insurance, retirement plans, paid time off, employee stock purchase options, wellness programs, SharkNinja product discounts, and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We empower your personal and professional growth &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;with high impact Learning Programs featuring bold voices redefining what’s possible. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When you join, you’re not just part of a company—you’re part of an outrageously extraordinary community. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;gether, we won’t just launch products—&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;we’ll disrupt entire markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At SharkNinja, Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion are vital to our global success. Valuing each unique voice and blending all of our diverse skills strengthens SharkNinja’s innovation every day. We support ALL associates in bringing their authentic selves to work, making an impact, and having the opportunity for career acceleration. With help from our leadership, associates, and our community, we aim to have equity be a key component of the SharkNinja DNA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
