&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with control owners to automate evidence gathering and ensure controls reduce friction rather than creating it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the primary Security POC for US regulators and partners; support the wider Security team with ISO 27001/27701 alignment.&lt;/p&gt;
