&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We recruit&amp;nbsp;people&amp;nbsp;at all levels based on merit. While our team members typically have excellent academic achievements, we are looking for &#39;street smart&#39; as well as &#39;book smart&#39;.&amp;nbsp;Don’t&amp;nbsp;worry about ‘ticking boxes’ if&amp;nbsp;you’ve&amp;nbsp;got the consulting skills and&amp;nbsp;knowledge&amp;nbsp;we are after, we would love to talk to you. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
